---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <div class="crew-orbit" aria-label="选择航海心情">
  {% for frame in crew %}<button type="button" class="crew-frame frame-{{ loop.index }}" data-mood="{{ frame.title }}" aria-label="{{ frame.alt }}：{{ frame.title }}"><img src="/assets/images/crew-{{ frame.id }}-small.webp" alt="{{ frame.alt }}" width="480" height="270" {% if loop.index > 6 %}loading="lazy"{% else %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}></button>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy"><h1 id="home-title"><span>张峰瑜的</span><span>伟大航线</span></h1><p class="hero-description">在代码里探索，在生活里冒险。<br>记录技术、学习与生活的中文博客。</p><a class="button primary" href="#journal">翻开航海日志 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><span id="mood" aria-live="polite">好奇心，就是记录指针。</span><button class="orbit-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" hidden>暂停环绕</button></div>
</section>
<section class="home-journal section-wrap" id="journal" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
  <div class="section-heading reveal"><h2 id="journal-heading">航海日志</h2><a href="/journal/">全部日志 →</a></div>
  <div class="journal-layout"><div class="journal-intro"><p class="statement reveal">每次弄懂，<br>每段经历，<br>都留下一页。</p><img class="journal-picture reveal" src="/assets/images/crew-2.webp" alt="草帽一伙的分镜群像" width="1080" height="2340" loading="lazy"><div class="category-links">{% for category in site.categories %}<a href="/categories/{{ category | slugify }}/">{{ category }}</a>{% endfor %}</div></div><div>{% set posts = collections.posts %}{% include 'post-list.njk' %}</div></div>
</section>
<section class="home-gallery section-wrap" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading"><div class="section-heading reveal"><h2 id="gallery-heading">航海影集</h2><a href="/gallery/">展开影集 →</a></div><p class="section-lead reveal">伙伴在，航线就不孤单。</p><div class="gallery-band">{% for id in [12,8,7,11] %}<a href="/gallery/#image-{{ id }}" class="gallery-panel reveal"><img src="/assets/images/crew-{{ id }}.webp" alt="{% if id == 12 %}背上行囊，向远方出发{% elif id == 8 %}围桌举杯的草帽一伙{% elif id == 7 %}伙伴们的环形合影{% else %}一起享用美食的伙伴们{% endif %}" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"><span>{% if id == 12 %}向远方{% elif id == 8 %}为今天干杯{% elif id == 7 %}一起冒险{% else %}好好吃饭{% endif %}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="home-about section-wrap" aria-labelledby="about-heading"><div class="about-label reveal"><h2 id="about-heading">关于我</h2><a href="/about/">认识张峰瑜 →</a></div><div class="about-copy reveal"><img src="/assets/images/crew-1-small.webp" alt="路飞笑脸主题头像" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy"><p>我是张峰瑜，电信工程及管理本科在读，正在探索 AI 应用开发与游戏设计开发。</p><p>从 Python 编程到 RAG 与 Agent，把学习留在笔记里，也把想法做成可以运行的作品。</p></div></section>
